    "\n",
    "# Analysis\n",
    "- The analysis indicates that students’ average exam performance was higher in the previous year compared with the current year, with the average score declining from 69.53% in the previous year to 61.95% in the current year.\n",
    "\n",
    "- Furthermore, the analysis shows a significant decline in the proportion of students achieving scores within the **60–80% range, decreasing from 61.9% in the previous year to 42.0% in the current year**, and within the **80–100% range, decreasing from 17.5% to 11.9%**. This indicates an overall deterioration in students’ academic performance compared with the previous year.\n",
    " \n",
    "# Recommendation \n",
    "\n",
    "- Conduct a detailed analysis to identify the key factors contributing to the decline in results compared with the previous year by comparing student-related factors between the previous and current years, including attendance, study hours, sleep, motivation, stress levels, study methods, and other relevant academic factors."
